PlatformID,SourceConnectionComponentName,TargetConnectionComponentName
Prd_WinDom_Adm_HTML5,PSM-HTML_OVERIDE,PSM-RDP
Prd_WinDom_Adm_HTML5,PSM-HTML_OVERIDE,PSM-SSH
Prd_WinDom_Adm_HTML5,PSM-HTML_OVERIDE,PSM-SQL



